# build/js-demo.hxml — the same runtime, compiled to JavaScript.
# Run from the repository root:  haxe build/js-demo.hxml && node out/_demo/js/demo.js --headless-hash 300
#
# The JS target is where the emulator is developed and verified: Haxe's JS backend is mature and
# correct, the edit-run loop is seconds long, and its digest is the reference the C++ build must
# reproduce. The project is still SHAPED for reflaxe.CPP — the portable subset and every
# constraint in ADR-0002 apply here too, even where JavaScript would not require them.
-cp src/runtime
-cp src/shims/js
-main Main
-js out/_demo/js/demo.js
-dce full
